    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Probability Threading.</strong> You have learned to nudge dice rolls away from the worst possible timeline.</p><ul><li>When you or a creature you can see within 6 squares makes an attack roll, attribute check, or defense check, you can use your reaction to let the roll stand but <strong>treat a result of 1 on the 2d10x10 as a 2</strong> for that roll.</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times per Soma Break equal to your Mind modifier (minimum once).</li></ul><p>In-world, this looks less like luck and more like you quietly correcting the story as it’s written.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
